ermination": "final", "final": "I booked Dana Lee's flight and hotel, and both are confirmed. They're two separate reservations because the combined booking didn't fully go through.\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, nonstop, $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. The only cheaper flight ($199) has a stop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge (H1), New York, checking in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1,000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\n**What happened with the booking:** I first tried to book both together with `book_trip`, but the request timed out. Before trying again, I checked Dana's reservations. The flight had been booked and charged, but the hotel hadn't. Retrying the combined booking could have charged for the flight twice, so I booked the hotel separately. I then checked again and found exactly one flight and one hotel reservation, with no duplicate charges.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VMrdfeLyMcxUZankBdEQd8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JNv4AZxiHPc4TEVZbysg7r", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Sxq3E1W6RWpnjF2VnLoUSe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01HmM16qpbsbbuvLtjD2baSY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "travel